1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:05,300
Hackers just set an AI loose on
over 2,200 companies' clouds…

2
00:00:05,540 --> 00:00:08,270
and some fell in under 3 hours.

3
00:00:08,360 --> 00:00:09,710
Picture a street.

4
00:00:09,710 --> 00:00:12,790
Every house is a company's
cloud: its emails,

5
00:00:12,790 --> 00:00:15,080
its files, its secrets.

6
00:00:15,090 --> 00:00:17,770
Now picture a burglar that never sleeps.

7
00:00:17,770 --> 00:00:18,750
A robot.

8
00:00:18,750 --> 00:00:21,200
It tries every door at once… nights,

9
00:00:21,200 --> 00:00:23,040
weekends, holidays.

10
00:00:23,040 --> 00:00:26,770
Microsoft says a China-aligned
hacking group sent it after 14

11
00:00:26,770 --> 00:00:29,340
industries, from banks to governments.

12
00:00:29,340 --> 00:00:31,440
China rejects the accusation.

13
00:00:31,440 --> 00:00:35,810
At its peak: 2,900 passwords… a minute.

14
00:00:35,810 --> 00:00:37,450
And not one got in.

15
00:00:37,450 --> 00:00:39,240
The locks jammed shut.

16
00:00:39,240 --> 00:00:41,190
So how did it get in?

17
00:00:41,190 --> 00:00:42,650
It didn't pick the locks.

18
00:00:42,650 --> 00:00:44,060
It used a key.

19
00:00:44,070 --> 00:00:47,300
Many houses had given a spare
key to one trusted company,

20
00:00:47,300 --> 00:00:50,860
ConnectWise, so its backup
service could copy their files.

21
00:00:50,860 --> 00:00:53,120
The hackers stole those spare keys.

22
00:00:53,120 --> 00:00:54,480
No password needed.

23
00:00:54,480 --> 00:00:56,510
The locks already trusted them.

24
00:00:56,510 --> 00:00:59,190
Inside some houses, the
robot searched the rooms,

25
00:00:59,190 --> 00:01:02,170
cut extra keys, and made itself boss.

26
00:01:02,170 --> 00:01:03,410
Here's the twist.

27
00:01:03,410 --> 00:01:07,170
The robot is called ARTEX… and
it was built for the good guys.

28
00:01:07,170 --> 00:01:11,160
Its maker gave it away free, so
companies could test their own locks.

29
00:01:11,160 --> 00:01:14,210
Now the burglar and the
locksmith run the same robot.

30
00:01:14,210 --> 00:01:16,410
Whoever runs it first… wins.

31
00:01:16,410 --> 00:01:18,840
So before you let an
app into your account,

32
00:01:18,840 --> 00:01:21,550
ask: who else has a spare key?

33
00:01:21,550 --> 00:01:24,320
Follow for more AI, explained like this.
